# Reusable throwaway Supabase accounts for the geometry sweep
# (e2e/helpers.ts::acquirePooledElder). Holds real, if disposable, credentials —
# and it exists precisely because signup throttling makes fresh ones unreliable,
# so it is machine-local state, not something to share.
apps/web/scratchpad/.dw-elder-pool.json
# Debug screenshots from the scratchpad visual specs (19MB / 200+ PNGs from
# geometry sweeps, filmstrips and one-off diagnostics). The SPECS are committed
# and regenerate these on demand, so carrying the images in git buys nothing and
# grows the repo forever. The sweep's report JSONs are small text and ARE kept —
# MEMORY.md cites them as the baseline a future run diffs against.
apps/web/scratchpad/shots/**/*.png
apps/web/scratchpad/shots/*.png

# --- Supabase (local) ---
supabase/.branches/
supabase/.temp/

